          </div>
        </div>
        
        <form action="{{ route('auth.logout') }}" method="POST">
          {{ csrfField() }}
          <button type="submit" class="btn-logout" style="background: none; border: none; cursor: pointer;">Déconnexion</button>
        </form>
      </header>

      <section class="dashboard-grid">
        <div class="card">
          <h3>Visibilité de la structure</h3>
          <p>Gérez vos services et touchez vos clients locaux efficacement.</p>
